  "I4" [label="(0,0,0) Deduction-case: Currently there is a need for CP single crystals, and manufacturing is a significant barrier."];
  "N1" [label="(1,0,0) Conjugated polymers are pioneering in wearable, biocompatible, and neuromorphic thin-film electronics."];
  "N10" [label="(8,0,0) On the kinetic front, molecular dipoles are expected to accelerate the nucleation."];
  "N11" [label="(0,0,0) Induction-reasoning: Dipoles influence energy landscape and accelerate nucleation, so dipoles offer crystallization benefits."];
  "N13" [label="(9,0,0) Accelerated nucleation is often accompanied by high-density random crystal nuclei, leading to polycrystals."];
  "N14" [label="(10,0,0) Molecular dipoles are highly sensitive to both molecular configurations and stacking conformations."];
